 components that need to be installed on the customer site and no mobile app.\n\nThe PowerCore system is modular based, with four primary solutions that can be enabled:\n\n-        PowerCore ISO/RTO enables market participants to perform scheduling, automated data downloading, shadow settlements and statement validation, allocations, and reporting. \n\n-        PowerCore Visual Analytics provides a visual dashboard for Generators to analyze ISO/RTO and internal data including schedules, real-time dispatch, meter, pricing, position management, and estimated profits and losses in a single graphical interface. \n\n-        PowerCore Contract Billing is used to help automate the settlement of complex power purchase agreements, tolling agreements, or other power contracts. \n\n- PowerCore ETRM (Energy Trading and Risk Management) is an integrated solution for automating front-office, mid-office, and back-office business processes related to the deal capture of power and natural gas deals with counterparties.","event_log":[{"date":"2024-09-10T04:00:00.000Z","category":"Status Change","description":"Status set to Agency Authorization In Process","cert_type":"Rev5","cert_path":"Agency","cert_class":"Class C"},{"date":"2025-03-28T04:00:00.000Z","category":"Status Change","description":"Status changed from Agency Authorization In Process to FedRAMP In Process","cert_type":"Rev5","cert_path":"Agency","cert_class":"Class C"},{"date":"2025-05-15T04:00:00.000Z","category":"Status Change","description":"Status changed from FedRAMP In Process to FedRAMP Certified","cert_type":"Rev5","cert_path":"Agency","cert_class":"Class C"}]},"kept":{"annual_assessment":{"value":"03/27","as_of":"2026-04-14","source":"old_feed","shown_until":"2026-11-03","label":"Annual assessment"},"auth_date":{"value":"2025-05-15","as_of":"2026-04-14","source":"old_feed","shown_until":"2026-11-03","label":"Authorization date"},"fedramp_auth_date":{"value":"2025-05-15","as_of":"2026-04-14","source":"old_feed","s